# Changelog
All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [0.2.6] - 2022-01-18
### Added
- Rolling update option set as default
- Container name set to service name
- Ingress support for Kubernetes v1.22+

## [0.2.7] - 2024-10-07
### Changed
- Chart API version changed v1 -> v2

## [0.3.0] - 2025-01-07
### Changed
- Statefullset added

## [0.3.1] - 2025-01-07
### Changed
- Headless service added for sts deployment

## [0.3.2] - 2025-01-08
### Changed
- remove common service on sts deployment

## [0.3.3] - 2025-01-09
### Changed
- fix ingress on sts deployment

## [0.3.4] - 2025-01-09
### Changed
- roleback: fix ingress on sts deployment

## [0.3.5] - 2025-01-10
### Changed
- fix: dynamic volume on sts